これまでの積み上げてきたもののベンダーの継ぎはしのシステムじゃなくて、本当に問題がどこにあるかというのを確認をして、それで予…", "…じていただきたいと改めてお願いをいたします。なぜなら、この機構は、システム独占だけじゃなくて、マイナンバーカード発行も独占しているんですよ。…"]}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/150", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/152", "sentence": ["…れるのは、十万円の給付が行かない、目詰まりはどこで起きているのか、システムは何が問題なのか、これをまず早急に、あるいは法改正が必要だったら、…"]}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/155", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/157", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/159", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/162", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/164", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/166", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/168", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/173", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/175", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/177", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/181", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/183", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/185", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/187", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/189", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/191", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/193", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/195", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X02120200611/197", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/1